   "source": [
    "The parser job in Python for example:\n",
    "```\n",
    "PythonParser\n",
    "    ↓\n",
    "creates AST\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3201fb98",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "The analyzer:\n",
    "```\n",
    "PythonASTAnalyzer\n",
    "    ↓\n",
    "examines AST\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "baed0dfc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "So it will be \n",
    "```\n",
    "code\n",
    " ↓\n",
    "parser.parse(code)\n",
    " ↓\n",
    "tree\n",
    " ↓\n",
    "analyzer.analyze(tree)\n",
    " ↓\n",
    "result\n",
    "```"
   ]
  }
 ],
